{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"636019409797775360","content":"Leaf let's the silence hang for a moment, unsure of where to start. Finally, she begins choosing her words careful and slowly, \"I... I used to be ashamed of speaking goblin. People would hear me talking with it on the road and they'd immediately be... It was like they were angry with me. It was even worse before I learned to look civilized.\" Her hands run over her dress out of habit. \"I was really worried when I came to London, but somehow, there were people there who were willing to actually *see* me. And- and speak with me. And everyone was so kind.\" She pauses to think, \"I honestly was willing to never speak goblin again. It's why I learned Elvish so quickly. I thought it made me sound smarter, more refined. But somehow, when I heard you say it... It was different. You're smart, and you speak goblin...\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T20:23:37.634000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737404854506356847","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
